  "title": "monday.com Welcomes AI Agents to Its Platform, Marking a Shift in How Work Gets Done - monday.com",
  "summary": "NEW YORK & TEL AVIV, Israel–(BUSINESS WIRE)–monday.com (NASDAQ: MNDY), the AI work platform that turns strategy into execution at scale, today announced new infrastructure that enables AI agents acting on behalf of humans to sign up, authenticate, and operate directly within the monday.com platform. With dedicated agent onboarding and purpose-built infrastructure, monday.com now enables external AI agents […]",
